WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.384
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind refined mouse skills.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.744
Single click: selects an item. Double click: opens many files or apps.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.616
Drag: holds the button while moving an item. Scroll wheel: moves through a page.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:19.830
Right click: opens a context menu in many systems.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.290
With an adult supervising, practise single click and double click using a computer if

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:30.207
one is available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a

00:00:30.207 --> 00:00:30.535
partner.
